  "details": "Distance Slider isn't linear anymore. Which makes it difficult to set for some values. Many Distances between 2m and 5m are my popular choice in many instances.\n\nGiving the first half meter is about 35% of the slider appears to me useless when i consider that this is an idle movement of a staying person.\n\nI would like to have something like:\n\n* 0-5m (0-75%) linear \n\n* 5-10m (75%-100%) exponential curve",
